## The rules

Numbered so they can be cited, and written so they can be **contradicted**. A rule nothing could
violate is not a rule, it is a mood.

The contract that makes this file worth having: **if a change cuts against a rule below, that is
allowed — but the plan has to say which rule and why.** An intentional tension stated out loud is a
decision. An unstated one is a defect nobody catches.

